# Rancher phase

K3s (no traefik), Rancher Prime on NodePort 30002.

No ingress → cert-manager CA ≠ Rancher TLS. Inject `CATTLE_INSECURE_TLS=true` via `agentEnvVars` on the `provisioning.cattle.io/v1` Cluster so cattle-cluster-agent skips TLS verify.

Import Harvester via **provisioning API**, not legacy `/v3/clusters`:

1. `kubectl apply` Cluster on Rancher (SSH heredoc — not echo+pipe)
2. Poll `.status.clusterName` → `c-m-xxxxx` (≤2 min)
3. Create `ClusterRegistrationToken` in that namespace
4. Poll `.status.manifestUrl` (≤2 min)
5. Apply `cluster-registration-url` Setting on Harvester (local kubectl stdin)
6. Wait Active in Rancher v3 API (≤30 min)

Install Harvester UI Extension before import (default `1.7.1`; override `versions.harvester_ui_extension`).

Helm bootstrapPassword: values file via heredoc + `helm upgrade --install -f` — never `--set` on argv.
